+# Not theoretical here. `tofu plan | tee` reported success and posted an
+# empty pull request comment, and `rclone version | head -1` verified
+# nothing while passing - both silent, both green, both wrong answers
+# rather than errors. It is set on every workflow, including those with no
+# `run:` step today, so the one added tomorrow is already covered.
